Better error message with Custom Forward and Module Container
We don't support a custom forward for ModuleList, ModuleDict, or Sequential. We should give a better error message in these cases.
class TestModuleList(nn.ModuleList):
    def forward(self, x):
        ret_list = []
        for mod in self.mods: 
            ret_list.append(mod(x))
        return ret_list
class Test(nn.Module):
    def __init__(self):
        super().__init__()
        self.embed = TestModuleList()
    def forward(self, x):
        return self.embed(x)

